k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","review_id":"ORy6U55tcIY1oXUfaqNbtQ","date":"2018-05-28T03:49:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9393395781517029,"text_excerpt":"I'm so glad French Truck Coffee was a brisk walk from our hotel. It was everything I could have asked for in a coffee shop - hipster, open space, and great coffee. Located in the French Quarter, French Truck Coffee meets your iced coffee, pour over and espresso needs. I tried a couple different drinks the various times I went - the Japanese Oji iced coffee, a cortado and a cappuccino. The espresso is solid - nothing overbearing. The Japanese Oji was potent but also not watery as some ice coffee could be. Not quite on the Starbucks cold brew level of strong (thank god, although sometimes there is a time and place that is needed) but kept me going the rest of the day. I'll definitely need t..."},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","review_id":"_dY188Kl9Lrwn2-CWjPswQ","date":"2018-03-22T13:34:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387342929840088,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I stopped by here for coffee before breakfast one morning during our trip. It's centrally locates in the French quarter. Very adorable, decent amount of seating. I got a pour over coffee and my husband got an iced coffee, both were delicious and smooth. Zero complaints, definitely check this place out!"},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","review_id":"d_kTmfa8TxeP6avmwD54xg","date":"2018-10-14T16:09:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9366946220397949,"text_excerpt":"Cute cafe in the French Quarter. The baristas were very friendly. The espresso was well pulled. The New Orleans iced coffee (a coffee/chicory blend) was decent, though I'm just not a fan of chicory coffee. It was refreshing, though."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","photo_id":"QIT_U3DeetPhARbyCUwr8w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QIT_U3DeetPhARbyCUwr8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.902377724647522},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","photo_id":"kvu8UlbpSJD347-lkH2x_A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/kvu8UlbpSJD347-lkH2x_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8660120964050293},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","photo_id":"PZomymyixg5V9XDYQou8aw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PZomymyixg5V9XDYQou8aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8653604984283447},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","photo_id":"ScdqEU-Ue-TBBu7JEIWkYw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ScdqEU-Ue-TBBu7JEIWkYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8261614441871643},{"business_id":"1Mmo93UBNsaVW7OnpWDuQg","photo_id":"pR4_Wu8UDSZlVtU-0g-AHw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pR4_Wu8UDSZlVtU-0g-AHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8033746480941772}]},"notebook_case":null}
